{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Cadence 是一款把日常口語任務化成實際行程的排程工具，適合需要兼顧工作、專注與回顧的用戶；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-151.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自然語句智能排程</h2>\n<p>你可像說話般輸入任務，日期、時間與時長會自動辨識，系統會在行程與工作時段中找出空檔，儲存前先讓你確認或自選時間；日程畫面顯示下一個任務與開始按鍵，未完成工作會安靜順延，並配合專注計時、週行程圓盤、裝置端 AI 與離線私隱設計，讓排程更輕鬆。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-160-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-161-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-162-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-163-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-164-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-165-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Cadence – Task Planner</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cadence-task-planner/id6806902304?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:44:49.843557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T17:35:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T21:41:12.847141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:38:20.739287+00:00","content_hash":"9dccfc1c693873118989f000fb4b6eeb0b8ed0c430b8ba59d33bda02bde9215a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}